SPECIFICITY: SPECIFIC

1. Strongman Striker Revival - Implement The Bell's Curse mechanic as described in GDD section 3.2.4.
   This involves adding code that randomly shifts the bell up or down the vertical tower between swings of the mallet,
   affecting game physics calculations for collision detection and puck trajectory prediction.

2. Weighted Puck Integration - Incorporate "Weighted Pucks" with reduced maximum heights into the existing attraction level system.
   Modify MidwayPhysics.SpawnDynamicSphere to account for increased mass by adjusting initial velocity vectors based on starting height.
   
3. Echo Strikes Rhythm System - Develop a rhythm-based scoring mechanism tied to consecutive hits at specific spots within each swing cycle.
   When players hit these areas repeatedly without missing (accumulating tension), award bonus Soul Tokens; reset upon failure.
   Integrate this feature using Engine.AwardTokens APIs to manage token distribution across gameplay sessions. 

